 2025-09-17   : 8.0.0
              - Release 8.0.0
                New vpn info variable: dns_lookup_ipv6
                  When true, hostnames listed in "dns" lists are now queried for
                  IPv6 as well as IPv4 address(es). These are used in the wireguard configs.
                  Defaults to false.
